{"availability":"available","full":"EDGARZR54/StreetDataInsight","name":"StreetDataInsight","description":"\"Street Data Insight\" is a Grasshopper plugin that provides a tool for urban planners and architects to reconstruct digital street profiles.","category":"Design","language":"Python","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2023-03-21T19:15:20Z","updated":"2026-09-07T18:11:46Z","branch":"StreetDataInsight","homepage":"https://edgarzr54.github.io/StreetDataInsight/","topics":["architecture-design","computervision","facades","multiperspectivepanorama","urban-profile","urban-studies"],"demo":"https://edgarzr54.github.io/StreetDataInsight/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T02:37:14.913Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T02:37:14.913Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T02:37:14.913Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T02:37:14.913Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["When planning an urban-architectural intervention in public space, it is essential to have a solid understanding of the environment in which it is located, in order to fully appreciate its relationship with the city or the surrounding landscape. This study presents a methodology based on the acquisition and processing of geospatial data to digitally reconstruct urban profiles, with the aim of analyzing and planning public space.","Street Data Insight is a plugin composed of 7 categories and more than 70 components, designed as an experimental toolset for urban planners and architects. It provides custom tools to reconstruct, visualize, and process street environments through geolocation, spatial orientation, and georeferenced operations on street networks and urban blocks, leveraging panoramic imagery, depth data, and computer vision techniques within the Rhino and Grasshopper ecosystem.","The plugin incorporates advanced features uncommon in typical Grasshopper extensions, including a custom graphical user interface, animated icons, GPU-accelerated processes, refined UX details, and live preview capabilities directly within component capsules, enabling a more interactive and responsive workflow."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/EDGARZR54/StreetDataInsight/blob/StreetDataInsight/README.md","fingerprint":"da2d67096ea11cadb0a8a09a8775174d14a644bc7ac8e80b6140788fffcbd429","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T02:37:15.038Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T02:37:15.038Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"When planning an urban-architectural intervention in public space, it is essential to have a solid understanding of the environment in which it is located, in order to fully appreciate its relationship with the city or the surrounding landscape. This study presents a methodology based on the acquisition and processing of geospatial data to digitally reconstruct urban profiles, with the aim of analyzing and planning public space.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/EDGARZR54/StreetDataInsight/blob/StreetDataInsight/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"da2d67096ea11cadb0a8a09a8775174d14a644bc7ac8e80b6140788fffcbd429","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/EDGARZR54/StreetDataInsight/blob/StreetDataInsight/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T02:37:15.039Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-07T18:11:46Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/EDGARZR54/StreetDataInsight/blob/StreetDataInsight/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T02:37:15.039Z","hash":"da2d67096ea11cadb0a8a09a8775174d14a644bc7ac8e80b6140788fffcbd429","originalBytes":13735,"storedBytes":13735,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["street","data","insight","development","license","grasshopper","plugin","rhino","urban","version","any","apache","edgar","guez","public","rodr","software","windows","zambrano","adobe","available","custom","depth","edgarzr54","environments","experimental","express","food4rhino","generation","georeferenced","image","including","leveling","networks